abstract: "OmniEarth is a universal, open-source multi-modal data engine, CLI, and dual SDK (Python & Node.js) for discovering, streaming, and downloading optical, SAR, hyperspectral, weather, soil, elevation, land cover, atmosphere, fire, ocean, altimetry, precipitation, hydrology, and nightlight datasets across global open repositories."
